meta {
  name: Signals
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  Public signal ingestion (token in URL, no JWT):
  - POST /v1/webhook/:token  (BUY / SELL / CLOSE)

  **Live Indian equity:** Webhooks → create-indian → ingest-indian-buy (include `price`)
  **Pro Plus multi-product:** add `"product": "MIS"|"CNC"|"NRML"` — see ingest-indian-cnc
  **Forex (MT5):** Webhooks → create → ingest-buy / ingest-sell / ingest-close

  Paper-destination webhooks use the **Paper Trading** folder typed payloads instead.
}
